<th id="mwmA">tera<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FLOPS" title="FLOPS" class="mw-redirect" id="mwmQ">FLOPS</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FP16" title="FP16" class="mw-redirect" id="mwmg">FP16</a>)</th></tr>
